      "findings": [
        "Publisher Saṅkamanattā versus VRI Saṅkamanatthā is an edition-specific title difference; preserve both labels.",
        "Publisher31 names Koṇḍañña where VRI main has Vipassī; VRI original variant preserves the publisher-name reading.",
        "Preserve VRI abbreviation in34–36; publisher full stanzas do not authorize expansion of root text."
